1
00:00:00,165 --> 00:00:03,615
(Leonard:)You still got the part.
That's a huge accomplishment.

2
00:00:03,768 --> 00:00:04,838
(Penny:)But this was supposed
to be my break, okay?

3
00:00:05,003 --> 00:00:06,213
(Penny:)People were gonna
see me in this show

4
00:00:06,371 --> 00:00:07,441
(Penny:)and it was gonna
lead to bigger things.

5
00:00:07,605 --> 00:00:10,445
(Penny:)More auditions, more parts.
Now none of that's gonna happen.

6
00:00:10,608 --> 00:00:13,348
Honey, you only had three lines.
That wasn't gonna happen anyway.

7
00:00:17,716 --> 00:00:20,526
(Penny:)Unbelievable.
-Oh, come on.

8
00:00:20,685 --> 00:00:23,065
(Leonard:)-That's not what I meant.
-Then what did you mean?

9
00:00:23,221 --> 00:00:26,721
I don't-- You know, words don't
always have to mean things.

10
00:00:26,891 --> 00:00:29,461
(Penny:)I think you meant
that you don't believe in me.

11
00:00:29,627 --> 00:00:32,867
Nope. Uh-uh. I might not
know what I meant,

12
00:00:33,031 --> 00:00:34,741
(Leonard:)but I know that
I didn't mean that.

13
00:00:34,899 --> 00:00:37,009
(Leonard:)Not this guy. Oh, no way.

14
00:00:37,168 --> 00:00:40,978
(Penny:)I want you, right now, to give me
your 100 percent honest opinion.

15
00:00:41,139 --> 00:00:44,849
(Penny:)Do you think I have what it takes
to really make it as an actress?

16
00:00:45,010 --> 00:00:46,580
(Leonard:)-Yes.
-So you think I'll be on TV

17
00:00:46,745 --> 00:00:48,315
(Penny:)and in movies and win awards.

18
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:50,020
(Leonard:)-Honestly?
-Yes, honestly.

19
00:00:51,549 --> 00:00:55,049
(Penny:)-I don't.
-How could you say that?

20
00:00:55,220 --> 00:00:58,200
(Leonard:)I don't know-- I got all confused
when you said "honestly."

